          <div class="advanced-content"><p v-if="p.s.render.family==='krea2'" class="hint">Krea 2 实验 · 纯自然语言，无角色 LoRA；步数与 CFG 跟随模型。</p><div class="field-grid"><label>步数<input v-model.number="p.s.render.steps" type="number" min="1" max="60" :disabled="p.busy || p.s.render.family==='krea2'" /></label><label>CFG<input v-model.number="p.s.render.cfg" type="number" min="0.5" max="10" step="0.5" :disabled="p.busy || p.s.render.family==='krea2'" /></label><label class="span-two">种子 Seed<input v-model="p.s.render.seed" type="number" placeholder="随机" :disabled="p.busy" /></label><label>采样器<Select v-model="p.s.render.sampler" label="采样器" :disabled="p.busy" :options="[{value:p.model.sampler,label:p.model.sampler}]" /></label><label>调度器<Select v-model="p.s.render.scheduler" label="调度器" :disabled="p.busy" :options="[{value:p.model.scheduler,label:p.model.scheduler}]" /></label><label v-if="p.s.render.family==='anima'" class="span-two">角色 LoRA 强度 <output>{{p.s.render.loraStrength}}</output><input v-model.number="p.s.render.loraStrength" type="range" min="0.65" max="1" step="0.05" :disabled="p.busy" /></label></div><label v-if="p.s.render.family==='anima'" class="check-row"><input v-model="p.s.render.hiresFix" type="checkbox" :disabled="p.busy" />高清修复</label><label v-if="p.s.render.family==='anima'" class="check-row"><input v-model="p.s.render.teaCache" type="checkbox" :disabled="p.busy" />TeaCache <small>依赖匹配配置</small></label></div>
        </details>
        <details class="form-section"><summary>推荐配方与复用<Icon name="chevron-down" /></summary><p class="hint">当前配方摘要：{{p.model.sampler}} / {{p.model.scheduler}}，{{p.model.steps}} 步，CFG {{p.model.cfg}}。原型不恢复历史或写入配方。</p></details>
